  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;this action will contribute to economic growth, job creation, food and nutrition security by improving the economic, social and environmental sustainability of fisheries and aquaculture value chains in ACP countries.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
